id           = CWE-1089
name         = Large Data Table with Excessive Number of Indices
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Incomplete

description : The product uses a large data table that contains an excessively large number of indices.

extended description : While the interpretation of "large data table" and "excessively large number of indices" may vary for each product or developer, CISQ recommends a default threshold of 1000000 rows for a "large" table and a default threshold of 3 indices.

notes : https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1089.html
